DESCRIPTION:Stopgap funding signed in September runs out at the end of 11 D
 ec. A shutdown can delay BLS data (CPI\, jobs) and SEC work\, and tends to
  add risk-off noise. Source: https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/1/us-ho
 use-passes-funding-bill-to-avert-government-shutdown-ahead-of-midterms. In
 fo only\, not a trade signal.
